<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH SC.ENERGETIKA POSTS CZK246MLN 96 NET.</title>
<headline>CZECH SC.ENERGETIKA POSTS CZK246MLN 96 NET.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for year ending December</p>
<p>31, 1996 (in millions of crowns).</p>
<p>			     1996	  vs	1995</p>
<p> Net profit		246.013		 268.422</p>
<p> operating profit	456.706		 609.227</p>
<p> write offs		  n/a		   408.647</p>
<p>sales from own</p>
<p> products, services   8,842.573	    8,506.141</p>
<p> production	     8,884.186	    8,608.229</p>
<p> assets		   7,409.610	    6,042.406</p>
<p> basic capital	  3,240.175	    3,224.463</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Severoceska Energetika a.s. It is a</p>
<p>regional energy distributor. The company said it would propose</p>
<p>paying a 50 crown dividend on 1996 results, the same as in</p>
<p>1995.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
